OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fmainly dry evening and night with some
OL,7,Fclear periods developing. More cloud
OL,8,Fin the far west at times. Winds mainly
OL,9,Flight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA mostly dry and bright day
OL,12,Fwith some sunny spells, and quite mild
OL,13,Fespecially along the north coast. More
OL,14,Fcloud possible in Upper Deeside.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA bright
OL,17,Fstart Friday then clouding over,
OL,18,Fpatchy rain. Saturday cloudy with
OL,19,Foccasional rain then Sunday dry with
OL,20,Fsome sunshine.
